Lambda Expression Alternative

Instead of using a for loop, Java 8 Streams can be used to find a country.

public Country getCountry(String code) {

    List<Country> countries = countryList.getCountries();

    return countries.stream()
            .filter(country -> country.getCode().equalsIgnoreCase(code))
            .findFirst()
            .orElse(null);

}
Advantages of Lambda Expression
Less code.
Easier to read.
Uses Java Stream API.
Suitable for filtering collections.
